      "rationale": "A clinical severity axis directly relevant to relating reasons-for-visit to urgency and duration; distinct from the coarse original urgency field. Values track the source text well (MI follow-up with no angina = asymptomatic, acne moderate = moderate). Minor softness: the annual physical with only mild fatigue labeled mild_symptomatic is defensible but slightly arguable versus preventive, indicating some subjective boundary calls."
